Package: admincleanr_crunch
Type: Package
Title: Exploratory "Crunch-Time" Helpers for Administrative Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Samuel", "Barans",
           email = "sam.a.barans@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Heuristic helpers for ad hoc cleaning when formats and keys are unclear:
    best-effort datetime parsing by scanning candidate orders; pairwise overlap
    scores to suggest merge columns; intended for iterative analysis rather than
    production pipelines.
